WEBVTT

01:49.820 --> 01:51.790
Come on! You're almost there!

01:51.820 --> 01:53.520
Keep it up!

01:53.560 --> 01:55.130
Nine hours, 12 minutes.

01:55.160 --> 01:58.660
Not bad given the conditions
you had to trudge through.

01:58.700 --> 02:00.060
[EREN sighs]

02:00.100 --> 02:02.530
Thought we were
dead out there.

02:02.570 --> 02:06.340
Dammit. Nobody said training
was gonna be this rough.

02:06.370 --> 02:08.810
Anyone else
not feel their legs?

02:08.840 --> 02:11.480
Why won't they
let us inside already?

02:11.510 --> 02:13.180
[SASHA] I bet they're busy
laying out a massive

02:13.210 --> 02:15.610
banquet for us as we speak.

02:15.650 --> 02:18.880
[REINER] Hey!
You guys seen Christa?

02:18.920 --> 02:20.180
[EREN]
Huh?

02:20.220 --> 02:22.320
Not for a while.
She was with Daz,

02:22.350 --> 02:24.290
and he wasn't doing so good.

02:24.320 --> 02:25.890
Yeah, well he's not here.

02:25.930 --> 02:28.130
Ymir isn't back yet either.

02:28.160 --> 02:30.460
[MARCO] They're probably
mixed in with the last squad.

02:30.500 --> 02:32.460
[REINER] That's just it.
Thomas was leading

02:32.500 --> 02:35.830
the last squad.
Says they never saw them.

02:35.870 --> 02:37.840
[All gasp]

02:40.240 --> 02:43.510
Whoa, hold on.
Do you think they're lost?

02:43.540 --> 02:44.910
Ooof. Man, if they
get stuck out there

02:44.940 --> 02:47.280
in this snowstorm,
they're done for.

02:47.310 --> 02:48.650
Son of a--!

02:49.520 --> 02:50.710
Eren!

02:50.750 --> 02:53.280
I have to go back out there
and try to find 'em!

02:53.320 --> 02:54.620
[MARCO]
I'm with you!

02:54.650 --> 02:56.550
[FEMALE INSTRUCTOR 30A]
In the cabin. Now.

02:56.590 --> 02:57.750
[EREN]
But, Christa and--

02:57.790 --> 03:01.130
We know. A rescue team will
be sent out at first light.

03:01.160 --> 03:02.760
They'll have frozen
to death by then!

03:02.800 --> 03:05.300
Do you want
more people to die?

03:13.940 --> 03:15.770
Dammit.

03:29.460 --> 03:32.260
[YMIR]
Christa.

03:32.290 --> 03:35.860
Seriously, give it up.
This is pointless.

03:38.360 --> 03:41.430
No it's not.

03:41.470 --> 03:44.900
[YMIR] Dumb bastard's got one
foot in the grave as it is.

03:44.940 --> 03:47.670
Nobody to blame but
himself if you ask me.

03:47.710 --> 03:49.270
Should've known
how much he could handle

03:49.310 --> 03:51.780
before trying
to boost his score.

03:51.840 --> 03:55.680
Some people just aren't
cut out to be soldiers.

03:55.710 --> 03:57.510
He'll be long gone
by the time you make it

03:57.550 --> 03:59.680
to the foot of that mountain.

03:59.720 --> 04:02.220
Rate we're going, we'll be
lucky not to join him.

04:02.250 --> 04:04.290
It's a zero sum game.

04:04.320 --> 04:07.460
Way I see it,
we've got two choices.

04:07.490 --> 04:10.730
Leave Daz to the elements
and save our own skin,

04:10.760 --> 04:12.860
or die a cozy little trio.

04:12.900 --> 04:15.700
What's it gonna be?

04:15.730 --> 04:17.430
You left one out.

04:17.470 --> 04:19.570
Third option:
you're completely wrong.

04:19.610 --> 04:21.870
I reach base in plenty
of time to save his life

04:21.910 --> 04:25.380
and by morning this is
all a bad memory.

04:25.410 --> 04:27.980
There's no reason
for you to stick with me.

04:28.010 --> 04:30.610
We'll only slow you down.

04:30.650 --> 04:33.350
You'll make it back
a lot faster on your own.

04:33.390 --> 04:35.520
Daz and I'll be
right behind you.

04:35.550 --> 04:37.790
Go on ahead.

04:43.760 --> 04:46.260
[CHRISTA gasps]

04:53.310 --> 04:55.440
So, uh...
You got something against

04:55.470 --> 04:58.940
asking me for help or what?

04:58.980 --> 05:01.910
Know what I think?
I think saving this moron

05:01.950 --> 05:04.980
is the furthest thing
from your mind.

05:16.800 --> 05:18.960
[YMIR] You're not
worried about Daz.

05:19.000 --> 05:23.670
You're just using him
as an excuse to die.

05:23.700 --> 05:27.870
This is how you want
your story to end. Right?

05:27.910 --> 05:31.540
What a shame. Here I thought
you were the good girl.

05:31.580 --> 05:33.080
Of course, if you can
make it look like you were

05:33.110 --> 05:35.950
trying to save his life,
no one will be the wiser.

05:35.980 --> 05:37.950
Hey. They'll remember
you as a hero

05:37.980 --> 05:40.480
who fearlessly
sacrificed herself.

05:40.520 --> 05:42.890
He's a small
price to pay, right?

05:42.920 --> 05:44.960
If you're a selfish bitch.

05:44.990 --> 05:47.860
[CHRISTA gasps]
That's not--!

05:47.890 --> 05:52.530
I never meant--
That's not me.

05:56.040 --> 05:58.640
[CHRISTA]
It's just...

06:00.070 --> 06:01.710
I know you.

06:01.740 --> 06:05.710
You're the mistress' daughter
with the price on her head.

06:05.740 --> 06:08.410
How could you possibly?

06:08.450 --> 06:13.050
[YMIR] Uh-huh.
There go any doubts I had.

06:13.090 --> 06:14.920
Let's just say
I have a knack for being

06:14.950 --> 06:17.650
in the wrong place
at the right time.

06:17.690 --> 06:20.460
Snuck inside a church
in the interior once

06:20.490 --> 06:21.860
scrounging around
for whatever might

06:21.890 --> 06:24.800
keep me alive another week.

06:24.830 --> 06:27.460
Quite a story
I got treated to.

06:27.500 --> 06:29.830
Apparently a high-ranking
noble produced more heirs

06:29.870 --> 06:31.700
than his people
were comfortable with.

06:31.740 --> 06:33.540
An illegitimate girl
was floating around

06:33.570 --> 06:35.540
they all feared might
come out of nowhere one day

06:35.570 --> 06:37.670
and claim a share
in his legacy.

06:37.710 --> 06:38.910
Some wanted her dead,

06:38.940 --> 06:40.780
some wanted to strip her
of the family name

06:40.810 --> 06:42.950
and hide her
among peasant stock.

06:43.020 --> 06:45.150
In the end, clever
bastards forced her

06:45.180 --> 06:47.420
to join the Cadet Corps.

06:49.150 --> 06:50.820
Don't worry, sweetheart.

06:50.860 --> 06:52.890
Your true identity
is safe with me.

06:52.930 --> 06:55.860
I haven't told a soul
and I don't plan to.

06:55.890 --> 06:58.830
So was, was your
whole reason for joining

06:58.860 --> 07:01.400
the Cadet Corps
just to find me?

07:01.430 --> 07:04.430
Why would you even care?

07:04.470 --> 07:06.770
[YMIR inhales]

07:06.810 --> 07:09.910
I dunno. Maybe I relate
to your struggle.

07:09.940 --> 07:11.840
[CHRISTA gasps]

07:11.880 --> 07:15.950
So we... have more
in common than I thought?

07:15.980 --> 07:19.680
Well, uh.
You could say that.

07:19.720 --> 07:22.420
I'm why you're...
a soldier?

07:22.450 --> 07:25.390
Could be.
I'm not positive.

07:25.420 --> 07:28.760
Uh, actually, no.

07:28.790 --> 07:30.760
So why, then?

07:30.800 --> 07:33.400
Did you want us
to become friends?

07:33.430 --> 07:37.430
Ha! You have
got to be joking.

07:38.870 --> 07:41.740
[YMIR] The only thing we have
in common is a second chance.

07:41.770 --> 07:44.710
Look, don't try to read
anything else into it, okay?

07:44.740 --> 07:47.880
Unlike you, I embraced
the name I was born with.

07:47.910 --> 07:51.750
If I throw it away and reject
who I am, then they win.

07:51.780 --> 07:53.620
I intend to live my life.

07:53.650 --> 07:55.990
Make my name mean something.

07:56.020 --> 07:58.160
Trust me, there's no
revenge in the world

07:58.190 --> 08:00.960
sweeter than that.
Look at yourself, Christa--

08:00.990 --> 08:02.390
or whoever you are.

08:02.430 --> 08:03.860
You've been a victim
all your life,

08:03.900 --> 08:05.530
and how do you
get your revenge?

08:05.560 --> 08:07.630
By becoming your own victim!

08:07.670 --> 08:10.030
Screw you and this
stupid death wish!

08:10.070 --> 08:15.110
If you kill yourself, you'll be
doing exactly what they want!

08:15.140 --> 08:19.680
I-- That's not how--
I just--

08:21.480 --> 08:23.210
I didn't mean
to get us into this

08:23.250 --> 08:26.180
and now there's
nothing we can do.

08:26.220 --> 08:28.080
[YMIR]
Bullshit.

08:36.930 --> 08:40.230
The base is a
straight drop from here.

08:42.670 --> 08:44.900
[YMIR] I say we
dump him off the cliff.

08:44.940 --> 08:46.540
[CHRISTA gasps]

08:46.610 --> 08:48.240
It's possible
he'll survive the fall.

08:48.270 --> 08:50.740
If they find him
then he might be okay.

08:50.780 --> 08:52.040
Sure, it's a long shot,

08:52.080 --> 08:54.910
but that's what
we're dealing with.

08:54.950 --> 08:57.050
Unless we're
due for a miracle,

08:57.080 --> 08:58.950
even if you live
to drag him down there

08:58.980 --> 09:00.920
all you'll have in tow
by the time you make it

09:00.950 --> 09:02.520
is a frozen corpse.

09:02.550 --> 09:06.960
But, if he falls
he'll die for certain!

09:06.990 --> 09:08.960
Enough of this shit!

09:08.990 --> 09:11.560
[CHRISTA] What are
you doing? Put me down!

09:11.600 --> 09:13.600
I'll handle Daz,
you get moving!

09:13.630 --> 09:15.730
[CHRISTA yells]

09:15.770 --> 09:18.030
[Grunts]

09:22.910 --> 09:25.610
[Distant rumble]

09:29.080 --> 09:35.820
[CHRISTA gasps and panting]

09:36.820 --> 09:38.760
[CHRISTA]
No.

09:38.790 --> 09:41.730
Ymir!

09:41.760 --> 09:44.630
Wait! Please!

09:48.800 --> 09:53.000
What's going on?

09:53.040 --> 09:54.840
Where did they--?

09:57.080 --> 09:59.940
[EREN] It's better if you guys
let me do this alone.

09:59.980 --> 10:01.710
Like our instructors said--

10:01.750 --> 10:04.650
We don't want more people
to die than may already have.

10:04.680 --> 10:06.950
That's precisely why
I'm coming with you.

10:06.990 --> 10:09.720
I can't just sit around
here and do nothing.

10:10.660 --> 10:13.220
[REINER] Really?
What the hell is this?

10:13.260 --> 10:15.030
[EREN] Look,
don't try to stop me!

10:15.060 --> 10:18.860
You're, uh, gonna need
a lot more gear.

10:18.900 --> 10:20.600
You can't do this
on your own.

10:20.630 --> 10:22.970
You'll end up just like the
folks you're trying to rescue.

10:23.000 --> 10:24.700
The more eyes you've got
in your search party,

10:24.740 --> 10:26.140
the better, right?

10:26.170 --> 10:28.200
Well, we--

10:28.240 --> 10:31.640
I suppose we could use
all the help we can get.

10:31.680 --> 10:34.810
[CONNY] Great.
Then count us in, too.

10:34.850 --> 10:37.150
Sounds like the storm's
letting up a little bit.

10:37.180 --> 10:38.720
We should be okay.

10:38.750 --> 10:40.620
I brought some extra
rations just in case!

10:40.650 --> 10:41.720
Thanks, guys.

10:41.750 --> 10:47.720
[Distant rumble]

10:47.790 --> 10:50.760
What was that?
An avalanche?

10:59.040 --> 11:01.170
Look, somebody's coming!

11:08.850 --> 11:16.690
[CHRISTA breathes laboringly]

11:16.720 --> 11:18.720
Ymir?

11:20.290 --> 11:21.830
It's about time.

11:21.860 --> 11:23.990
You decide to take
the scenic route?

11:24.030 --> 11:25.930
I told Reiner and the gang
I'd wait out here

11:25.960 --> 11:29.970
to be your welcoming
committee, so--

11:30.000 --> 11:33.040
Yeah, I know.
Stupid move on my part.

11:33.070 --> 11:35.040
Daz! Is he--?

11:47.490 --> 11:50.720
[CHRISTA] From all
the way up there?

11:50.760 --> 11:53.160
But you didn't have
any rope on you.

11:53.190 --> 11:56.290
And even if you did, how?

11:56.330 --> 11:59.330
It would've taken
hours to repel down!

12:03.440 --> 12:04.970
Yeah, all right.

12:05.000 --> 12:08.270
If I have to trust someone,
then it might as well be you.

12:08.310 --> 12:12.140
Just... gimme your word.

12:12.180 --> 12:14.040
When the day comes
for me to reveal myself

12:14.080 --> 12:17.180
to everyone, promise.

12:17.220 --> 12:20.780
Promise to take back your
name and live your life.

12:20.820 --> 12:22.850
[Gasps]

12:35.130 --> 12:37.430
[CHRISTA]
Ymir!

12:38.770 --> 12:41.340
[YMIR]
Christa. We're the same.

12:41.370 --> 12:45.310
I used to curse the day
I was born, just like you.

12:45.340 --> 12:49.380
The world despised me
for having the gall to exist.

12:49.410 --> 12:52.020
Heh. I thought the only
way to put things right

12:52.050 --> 12:55.420
was to give up my life.

12:55.450 --> 12:57.720
But even then,
what I wished for

12:57.760 --> 12:59.960
more than anything...

12:59.990 --> 13:02.890
...was to be given
a second chance.

13:02.930 --> 13:07.500
A chance to finally
live for myself!

13:10.170 --> 13:12.000
[Roars]

13:25.050 --> 13:26.550
[Roars]

13:28.450 --> 13:33.220
[CONNY] Talk to me. Somebody
tell me it's all a dream.

13:33.250 --> 13:35.150
Ymir.

13:35.190 --> 13:38.820
[Gasps]
It was her that day.

13:44.970 --> 13:46.870
She's the one.

13:56.210 --> 13:58.280
[Screams]

14:03.050 --> 14:05.080
Thank you, Reiner. I--

14:05.120 --> 14:06.020
[Yelps]

14:06.050 --> 14:08.090
Stop, you're hurting me!

14:08.120 --> 14:10.390
[CONNY]
Hey! Take it easy, man!

14:10.460 --> 14:15.030
That's enough! Let go! Let go!

14:16.360 --> 14:18.200
I'm so sorry!

14:18.230 --> 14:19.400
It's okay.

14:19.430 --> 14:20.570
Tell me the truth.

14:20.600 --> 14:23.940
You had to have been
in on all this.

14:23.970 --> 14:28.570
Ymir's a Titan.
How could you not know?

14:28.610 --> 14:31.240
She never told me.

14:31.280 --> 14:33.510
We were inseparable.

14:33.550 --> 14:37.280
And yet, I had no idea.

14:39.320 --> 14:42.090
I mean, how?

14:42.120 --> 14:44.160
[Roars]

14:44.190 --> 14:45.960
Not sure what to think.

14:45.990 --> 14:48.660
All this time she's been
keeping it under wraps

14:48.700 --> 14:51.460
and we never suspected
a damn thing.

14:51.500 --> 14:53.100
Yeah.

14:53.130 --> 14:57.000
Well, it's possible
she didn't know.

14:57.040 --> 14:59.000
Eren was caught off guard.

14:59.040 --> 15:01.870
He had no clue
till he transformed.

15:01.910 --> 15:05.510
Then again, Ymir did
seem to have a plan.

15:07.280 --> 15:08.950
Wait a second;
are you trying to say that

15:08.980 --> 15:10.380
Ymir is a threat?

15:10.420 --> 15:13.590
Maybe. It's a hell of
a power to hide.

15:13.620 --> 15:17.320
How she'll use it
is anybody's guess.

15:17.360 --> 15:18.920
For all we know
she could've been

15:18.960 --> 15:21.490
on their side all along.

15:24.130 --> 15:26.400
[Roars]

15:26.430 --> 15:28.300
[CHRISTA gasps]

15:30.300 --> 15:32.340
[CHRISTA]
Ymir!

15:56.100 --> 15:58.560
Whoa! What is she doing?

15:59.600 --> 16:01.330
[Roars]

16:01.370 --> 16:03.370
Oh, come on!
You're kidding, right?

16:03.400 --> 16:06.240
She's worried about
the tower falling down?

16:06.270 --> 16:09.340
Exactly. She didn't
have to stay.

16:09.380 --> 16:11.510
She could've chosen to escape.

16:11.550 --> 16:13.510
Nothing's keeping her here.

16:13.550 --> 16:18.580
And still...
She's fighting.

16:18.620 --> 16:22.690
It's us. She's risking
her life for us!

16:26.190 --> 16:29.630
Who are you?

16:29.660 --> 16:33.730
Why are you
doing this? Why?

16:35.770 --> 16:37.440
Don't you die on me!

16:37.470 --> 16:39.710
Not in a hovel
like this, damn you!

16:39.740 --> 16:40.810
Whoa!

16:40.840 --> 16:44.780
[CHRISTA] You want to be
the hero all of a sudden?

16:44.810 --> 16:47.550
Ha! Hoping to go out
in a blaze of glory?

16:47.580 --> 16:49.280
Don't make me laugh!

16:49.320 --> 16:51.420
Too late to
think about heaven now!

16:51.450 --> 16:54.590
You're a selfish bitch
and you know it!

16:54.620 --> 16:57.020
You'll die protecting
this stupid tower!

16:57.060 --> 16:59.960
Tear it to pieces!
Live for yourself!

16:59.990 --> 17:01.560
[CONNY]
Christa!

17:02.660 --> 17:12.640
[Intense music plays]

17:14.780 --> 17:17.340
Shit! Brace yourselves,
people. This is happening!

17:17.380 --> 17:19.540
Yeah! Atta girl!

17:23.280 --> 17:27.190
Wanna live? Grab on tight.

17:44.370 --> 17:48.040
[Rumble]

17:54.010 --> 17:55.750
[Coughs]

17:58.120 --> 18:00.490
[Both gasp]

18:03.460 --> 18:04.690
They're still not dead?

18:04.730 --> 18:08.360
Hey, ugly! You've got
a job to finish!

18:14.570 --> 18:16.470
Ymir!

18:16.500 --> 18:19.300
[TITAN YMIR panting]

18:23.410 --> 18:25.280
That's not good.

18:25.310 --> 18:28.650
[TITANS roar]

18:28.680 --> 18:39.620
[Squelching]

18:39.690 --> 18:43.230
They're eating her!

18:43.260 --> 18:46.830
[CHRISTA]
No. No, please.

18:48.800 --> 18:50.740
Christa, wait!

18:50.770 --> 18:55.070
[CHRISTA]
Ymir! Don't do this to me!

18:55.110 --> 18:59.480
Damn it! We had
a deal, remember?

18:59.510 --> 19:03.520
Hold on! I still haven't
told you my name!

19:03.550 --> 19:06.890
I promised you!

19:18.370 --> 19:21.830
[CHRISTA]
No! I still haven't...

19:32.680 --> 19:36.280
[MIKASA] Christa,
all of you, get back.

19:36.320 --> 19:39.890
It's okay. Let us
take care of this.

19:39.920 --> 19:42.520
Mikasa!

19:42.560 --> 19:44.260
[ALL gasp]

19:49.400 --> 19:51.260
[HANGE] Disperse and
canvas the area!

19:51.300 --> 19:52.500
The rest of you
follow me to where

19:52.530 --> 19:54.530
the Titans are gathering
and cut them down!

19:54.600 --> 19:56.430
Got it!

19:56.470 --> 20:00.140
Wait! You're not
part of the offensive!

20:02.310 --> 20:04.710
Die!

20:04.750 --> 20:07.750
Ha-ha!
My very first ODM kill!

20:09.520 --> 20:12.520
[EREN hollers]

20:12.550 --> 20:15.250
[KEIJI] Idiot!
I told you to fall back!

20:15.290 --> 20:17.220
Right! I'm sorry, sir!

20:17.260 --> 20:18.920
Ow, damn.

20:18.960 --> 20:22.590
[CONNY]
Hey! Eren!

20:22.630 --> 20:24.600
We found 'em!

20:40.550 --> 20:42.580
[Yells]

21:13.510 --> 21:17.950
Can't be. She's really...?

21:22.790 --> 21:25.590
[CHRISTA]
Ymir.

21:38.040 --> 21:41.070
Just as promised.

21:41.110 --> 21:44.910
My real name is Historia.

22:09.940 --> 22:14.910
♪ Closing Song
